    <string name="activity_rationale_title">Why Daymark reads activity</string>
    <string name="activity_rationale_body">Daymark reads your workouts and step counts from Health Connect to show them next to your habits, to let you add notes to workouts, and, if you choose, to mark a habit on days with a workout. The data is read only while you use the app, is not changed and is not sent anywhere. Notes stay on this phone.</string>
