    <string name="quest_intro_title">How quests work</string>
    <string name="quest_intro_body">When you look for a quest, Daymark reads your position once and asks OpenStreetMap (overpass-api.de) for public outdoor places nearby: parks, squares, viewpoints, monuments, fountains, public art. Your rounded position is sent for that search; nothing else leaves the phone. Homes, shops, clinics and other private or indoor places are never offered. When you are there, tap "I\'m here", or mark the quest by hand.</string>
